+          "message": "[P1] Invalidate the pending defaults debounce on target changes\n\nIf an edit schedules the 500 ms save and the operator changes `baseSelect` before it fires, `clearDefaultsSaveQueue()` only resets the flag; the pending callback still enters this new branch and queues a save for the new target. The subsequent load can then POST freshly loaded or fallback values to the newly selected gateway; cancel or invalidate the pending debounce when the target changes.\n\nstatic/admin.js:10481-10483",
