+          "id": "github-review-5557547606-finding-1",
+          "message": "[P2] Reconcile filtered key views after concurrent edits\n\nWhen an expiry PATCH response arrives after another input changed during the request, `inputsUnchanged` is false and this rerender is skipped. `updateKeyStatus()` only changes the existing row's state and text, so the key remains in the old Active/Expired tab and an extended key gets no new expiry timer until another reload or queued save.\n\nstatic/admin.js:7363-7363",
