+          "id": "github-review-5557547606-finding-2",
+          "message": "[P3] Give live expired rows a warning accent\n\nThe new status refresh writes `data-state=\"expired\"`, but `static/style.css` still defines accents only for `active`, `warning`, and `revoked`; rows that expire while open or are edited to an expired date therefore fall back to the muted accent instead of the warning accent. Use the warning state or add an expired-row rule.\n\nstatic/admin.js:7145-7148",
